msgstr "ສະແດງເອກະສານທັງຫມົດ>>"

#: app/katemailfilesdialog.cpp:54
msgid "&Mail..."
msgstr "ສົ່ງຈົດຫມາຍ..."

#: app/katemailfilesdialog.cpp:59
msgid ""
"<p>Press <strong>Mail...</strong> to email the current document."
"<p>To select more documents to send, press <strong>Show All "
"Documents&nbsp;&gt;&gt;</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<p>ກົດ<strong>ສົ່ງຈົດຫມາຍ...</strong> "
"ເພື່ອສົ່ງເອກະສານປະຈຸບັນໄປທາງຈົດຫມາຍອີເລັກໂທຣນິກສ໌"
"<p>ຫາກຕ້ອງການເລືອກເອກະສານທີ່ຈະສົ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໃຫ້ກົດ"
"<strong>ສະແດງເອກະສານທັງຫມົດ"
"&nbsp;&gt;&gt;</strong>"

#: app/katemailfilesdialog.cpp:64
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

#: app/katemailfilesdialog.cpp:106
